"聊了":[{"text":"汤姆和玛丽聊了一个晚上。","en":"Tom talked with Mary all night.","source":"tatoeba","id":1878014,"enId":1027974,"by":"fercheung"},{"text":"我和汤姆聊了一会。","en":"I had a conversation with Tom.","source":"tatoeba","id":13894764,"enId":2331562,"by":"jan_OkulaJu"},{"text":"你跟我聊了这么久不知道我叫什么？！","en":"You've been talking to me for so long, don't you know my name?!","source":"tatoeba","id":1523939,"enId":7221546,"by":"sysko"},{"text":"他们似乎是随意地聊了会儿","source":"aishell3","id":"SSB11100180"},{"text":"我也跟李克强总理聊了一分钟","source":"aishell1","id":"BAC009S0158W0332"}],
